      "contextFingerprint": "334381918947006220c8b5c8283d156f6a6b45bd733498b9b44cda81462f819d",
      "sourceText": "如果 clangd 没有找到数据库，它会进入 fallback 模式，只用少量默认\n参数分析源文件。这时即使 CMake 可以正常编译，VSCode 中仍可能出现：",
      "translatedText": "If clangd does not find the database, it enters fallback mode and analyzes source files using only a small set of default parameters\\. In this case, even if CMake can compile normally, the following may still occur in VSCode:",
      "provider": "deepseek",
