    "81a75d1de988de6d44e9eeff64d17e15beefaf7a022ac0c3ae9c0564a7e8ef5a": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "85a6417a5cacb071e6f56c58e7c963461029eda6b63f962965a468d0cfba4e0f",
      "contextFingerprint": "9f33a64b3d1f31df2d8f20b2cdbf2623b0bd381651f5cb12c8a6eb46d122642a",
      "sourceText": "1. 先看手动 `new/delete` 在提前返回时的问题。\n2. 用 `unique_ptr` 解决单一所有权和自动释放。\n3. 用 `std::move` 转移 `unique_ptr` 所有权。\n4. 只有确实共享所有权时，才用 `shared_ptr`。\n5. 用 `weak_ptr` 观察对象并打破循环引用。\n6. 函数参数要表达真实语义：借用、转移、共享是三件不同的事。",
      "translatedText": "1. First look at the problem with manual `new/delete` on early return\\.\n2. Use `unique_ptr` to solve single ownership and automatic release\\.\n3. Use `std::move` to transfer `unique_ptr` ownership\\.\n4. Only use `shared_ptr` when ownership is genuinely shared\\.\n5. Use `weak_ptr` to observe objects and break reference cycles\\.\n6. Function parameters should express true semantics: borrowing, transfer, and sharing are three different things\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 200,
        "outputTokens": 77,
        "costUsd": 0.000153
      }
