      "sourceText": "因此，换话题或改坐标系名称前，必须同时检查输入位姿究竟属于谁。改名字不会把底盘位姿自动变成云台位姿，也不会把世界 IMU 姿态变成关节角。源码没有查询或校验这些关系；上游内部 IMU→雷达转换、机械TF失败返回单位变换等已记录问题，也可能使这里用错角度。",
      "translatedText": "Therefore, before changing the topic or the coordinate frame name, you must simultaneously check whose pose the input actually is\\. Renaming will not automatically turn a chassis pose into a gimbal pose, nor will it turn a world IMU attitude into joint angles\\. The source code does not query or validate these relationships; documented issues upstream, such as the internal IMU\\-to\\-lidar transform and mechanical TF failure returning an identity transform, may also cause incorrect angles to be used here\\.",
